-- title:
--   q-LU factorization of the real Gaussian Toeplitz block
-- statement:
--   Let $\alpha, \sigma, b \in \mathbb R$ with $\alpha^2 \sigma > 0$, and let $T = $ `realToep α σ b n` be the real Gaussian Toeplitz block of the segmented inverse (entries $e^{-\pi\alpha^2\sigma (i-j)^2}$ twisted by $b$). With $q = e^{-2\pi\alpha^2\sigma}$ (`qR α σ`) and the coefficient sequences $b^{\pm}$ of the report,
--
--   $$T = \Gamma_q\, L(b^{-})\, \Gamma_q^{-1}\, U(b^{+})\, \Gamma_q.$$
--
--   In Lean:
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6QLU.realToep_qLU (h : 0 < α ^ 2 * σ) (n : ℕ) :
--       realToep α σ b n = Gam (qR α σ) n * lowT (bminus α σ b) * GamInv (qR α σ) n *
--         upT (bplus α σ b) * Gam (qR α σ) n
--   ```
